        "original_id": "6946703e-0e8a-5d45-be67-f70d8ce885c6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Zane, Amber Savva, Kelly Brook, Alki David\n- Products: Fishtales, Dead Calm, The Phantom, Titanic, Twin Peaks\n- Roles: Hughie, Kit Walker / The Phantom, Caledon Hockley, John Wheeler, Serena\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Zane was born on February 24, 1966, and he is an American actor and producer.\n- Billy Zane is known for playing Hughie in the 1989 thriller Dead Calm.\n- Billy Zane played Kit Walker / The Phantom in the 1996 superhero film The Phantom.\n- Billy Zane played Caledon Hockley in the 1997 epic romantic disaster film Titanic.\n- Fishtales is a 2007 family comedy film directed by Alki David.\n- Fishtales stars Billy Zane and Kelly Brook and is about a widowed father who falls in love with a mermaid.\n- Amber Savva is perhaps best known for playing Serena in the 2007 film Fishtales.\n- Billy Zane had a television role as John Wheeler in the serial drama series Twin Peaks.",
